re**: Properly computed with deterministic hash-based seed independent of training seed.\n3. **Model architecture**: Matches config, input_dim correctly set to 106.\n4. **Convergence**: Normal behavior\u2014initial rapid improvement with slight overfitting (val loss rising while train loss falling), typical for this task.\n5. **Completeness**: All expected outputs present (metrics.jsonl, logs, config.resolved.yaml, exitcode).\n\n### Conclusion\nThis is a **healthy run**. All components execute correctly, metrics show expected behavior, and there are no anomalies in configuration, code, or outputs.",
